    ('BIOL-X 150', 'ASURE BIOLOGY RESEARCH LAB 1', '10489', 'Class Status', 'W Wednesday 12:45 PM–4:00 PM', 'JH A010', 'Megan Murphy', 6, 'Laboratory', 'Discussion', '4', 'BIOLOGY BUILDING', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'First in a two-lab sequence for students in the Arts and Sciences Undergraduate Research Experience (ASURE) program. Students engage in guided research in an area related to the ongoing research of a faculty member. The specific topic of the class will vary by section and be determined by the faculty member associated with the section.', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], NULL),
