    ('BUS-Z 370', 'I-CORE - LEADERSHIP COMPONENT', '11934', 'Closed', 'MW Monday, Wednesday 3:45 PM–4:50 PM', 'HH 2083', 'Craig Medlyn', 0, NULL, 'Lecture', '3', 'HODGE HALL (BUSINESS SCHOOL)', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'Course will cover three main areas: 1)introduce concept of employees as a human resource, how leaders can combine personalities, knowledge, skills, and abilities of individual workers to achieve firm''s goals; 2) learn principles of peer-to-peer feedback and tools to analyze team effectiveness; 3) focus on leadership of an organization.', ARRAY['Class uses IU eTexts'], NULL),
