    ('HPSC-X 102', 'REVOLUTIONS IN SCIENCE: PLATO TO NATO', '11505', 'Class Status', 'TuTh Tuesday, Thursday 9:35 AM–10:50 AM', 'LI 026', 'Jesse Hannan', 1, 'Lecture', 'Lecture', '3', 'WYLIE HALL', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'An introduction to the formative steps in the scientific tradition. The course will survey in a chronological sequence aspects of the Aristotelian world view, the Copernican revolution, the mechanical philosophy, the chemical and Darwinian revolution, and the rise of twentieth century science.', ARRAY['IUB GenEd S&H credit
