    ('MATH-V 118', 'FINITE MATHEMATICS WITH APPLICATIONS', '5426', 'Class Status', NULL, 'MWF Monday, Wednesday, Friday 11:35 AM–12:25 PM Tu Tuesday 8:30 PM–9:30 PM Tu Tuesday 8:30 PM–9:30 PM Sa Saturday 10:00 AM–11:30 AM Sa Saturday 10:00 AM–11:30 AM Sa Saturday 10:00 AM–11:30 AM Sa Saturday 10:00 AM–11:30 AM Regular Academic Session 8/25/2025–12/19/2025', 'WB WEB WB WEB WB WEB PY 100 PY 101 PY 100 PY 101', NULL, NULL, 'Lecture', '3', 'WEB-BASED CLASS, PSYCHOLOGY', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'Sets, counting, basic probability, linear modelling, and other discrete topics. Applications to various areas depending on topic. Possibilities include social and biological sciences and consumer mathematics.', ARRAY['IUB GenEd Mathematical Modeling credit
