    ('MUS-P 720', 'JAZZ PIANO REVIEW FOR GRADUATE STUDENTS', '10211', 'Closed', 'MW Monday, Wednesday 5:30 PM–6:20 PM', 'MA 318', 'Luke Gillespie', 0, NULL, 'Lecture', '1', 'MUSIC ADDITION', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'Jazz keyboard skills and techniques. Meets the keyboard proficiency requirement with a grade of B or higher for graduate non-pianist Jazz Studies majors. Voicings for common harmonic formulae including the II/V7/I chord progression and the blues, simple modal voicings, rhythmic comping patterns, and simple comping patterns for Latin jazz styles.', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], NULL),
