    ('PSY-P 303', 'HEALTH PSYCHOLOGY', '12125', 'Class Status', 'MW Monday, Wednesday 12:45 PM–2:00 PM', 'PY 226', 'Natasha Chaku', 2, NULL, 'Lecture', '3', 'PSYCHOLOGY', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 'Focuses on the role of psychological factors in health and illness. Through readings, lecture, and discussion, students will become better consumers of research on behavior-health interactions and develop a broad base of knowledge concerning how behaviors and other psychological factors can impact health both positively and negatively.', ARRAY['COLL (CASE) N&M Breadth of Inquiry credit
